(131, '46', 34, 186, 14, 'Graduate Diploma in Management (Level 6)', 'Financial Principles and Techniques', 'Ushira Welikara', 'Good', 'Good', 'Average', 'Excellent', 'Poor', 'Average', 'Poor', 'Average', 'Thank you for the opportunity to provide my feedback.\r\n\r\nThe lecturer is very talented and knowledgeable, and I found his teaching style easy to follow. However, as someone who sometimes needs more than one example to fully understand a concept, I would appreciate having additional examples that explain the reasoning behind the concepts. This would help me apply what I learn to similar questions with greater confidence.\r\n\r\nI also noticed that the lectures were delivered in Sinhala more often than English. While this may not be an issue for most students, it can be challenging for students like me who are not very fluent in Sinhala, especially when learning academic content.\r\n\r\nI also felt that more attention was given to certain students than others. I believe it would be beneficial if all students were given equal opportunities to participate and receive guidance during the sessions.\r\n\r\nI would appreciate it if future sessions could include more example questions and ensure that the entire subject is covered thoroughly.', '2026-06-29 10:46:31', '2026-06-29 10:46:31'),
