(950, '41', 57, 293, 32, 'BTEC Higher National Diploma in Business', 'Business Law', 'Nizam Razzaq', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'The lecturer was highly knowledgeable, well organized, and explained every topic exceptionally clearly. The sessions were engaging, interactive, and supported with relevant real-life examples. The lecturer encouraged questions, ensured everyone understood the material, and created an excellent learning environment. Overall, it was an outstanding learning experience', '2026-07-09 09:03:05', '2026-07-09 09:03:05'),
(951, '41', 57, 294, 14, 'BTEC Higher National Diploma in Business', 'Recording Financial Transactions', 'Ushira Welikara', 'Good', 'Good', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Good', 'Average', 'Good', 'The lecturer was well prepared, explained the topics clearly, and maintained an engaging learning environment. The lessons were easy to understand, and the examples used helped reinforce the concepts. The lecturer encouraged questions and interacted well with students. However, the lectures were conducted mostly in Sinhala. Using more English during the sessions would help all students understand the content better. Overall, it was a very good learning experience.', '2026-07-09 09:04:23', '2026-07-09 09:04:23'),
(952, '41', 57, 291, 16, 'BTEC Higher National Diploma in Business', 'The Contemporary Business Environment', 'Anagi De Silva ', 'Good', 'Good', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'Good', 'Excellent', 'Good', 'The lecturer is kind, approachable, and creates a friendly learning environment. She explains the lessons clearly and is always willing to help students when they have questions. Her positive attitude makes the classes enjoyable. Overall, it was a very good learning experience.', '2026-07-09 09:05:18', '2026-07-09 09:05:18'),
